  chance alignment     R_chance_align < 0.01                            [Chae 2023 sec 2.1; El-Badry+2021 statistic]
  vtilde error         sigma(vt) <= 0.1 max(1, vt/2)                    [Banik+2024 eq.10 (bounds deep-bin noise inflation)]
